{
  "an10.106:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 10.106 ",
  "an10.106:0.2": "11. Perceptions for Ascetics ",
  "an10.106:0.3": "Wearing Away ",
  "an10.106:1.1": "“Mendicants, there are these ten grounds for wearing away. ",
  "an10.106:1.2": "What ten? ",
  "an10.106:1.3": "For one of right view, wrong view is worn away. ",
  "an10.106:1.4": "And the many bad, unskillful qualities that arise because of wrong view are worn away. ",
  "an10.106:1.5": "And because of right view, many skillful qualities are fully developed. ",
  "an10.106:2.1": "For one of right purpose, wrong purpose is worn away. ",
  "an10.106:2.2": "And the many bad, unskillful qualities that arise because of wrong purpose are worn away. ",
  "an10.106:2.3": "And because of right purpose, many skillful qualities are fully developed. ",
  "an10.106:3.1": "For one of right speech, wrong speech is worn away. ",
  "an10.106:3.2": "And the many bad, unskillful qualities that arise because of wrong speech are worn away. ",
  "an10.106:3.3": "And because of right speech, many skillful qualities are fully developed. ",
  "an10.106:4.1": "For one of right action, wrong action is worn away. ",
  "an10.106:4.2": "And the many bad, unskillful qualities that arise because of wrong action are worn away. ",
  "an10.106:4.3": "And because of right action, many skillful qualities are fully developed. ",
  "an10.106:5.1": "For one of right livelihood, wrong livelihood is worn away. ",
